INSERT INTO `mst_cobit4_control_objectives` VALUES (1,1,'PO1.1','IT Value Management','Work with the business to ensure that the enterprise portfolio of IT-enabled investments contains programmes that have solid business cases. Recognise that there are mandatory, sustaining and discretionary investments that differ in complexity and degree of freedom in allocating funds. IT processes should provide effective and efficient delivery of the IT components of programmes and early warning of any deviations from plan, including cost, schedule or functionality, that might impact the expected outcomes of the programmes. IT services should be executed against equitable and enforceable service level agreements (SLAs). Accountability for achieving the benefits and controlling the costs should be clearly assigned and monitored. Establish fair, transparent, repeatable and comparable evaluation of business cases, including financial worth, the risk of not delivering a capability and the risk of not realising the expected benefits.',1,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(2,1,'PO1.2','Business-IT Alignment','Establish processes of bi-directional education and reciprocal involvement in strategic planning to achieve business and IT alignment and integration. Mediate between business and IT imperatives so priorities can be mutually agreed.',2,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(3,1,'PO1.3','Assessment of Current Capability and Performance','Assess the current capability and performance of solution and service delivery to establish a baseline against which future requirements can be compared. Define performance in terms of IT\'s contribution to business objectives, functionality, stability, complexity, costs, strengths and weaknesses.',3,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(4,1,'PO1.4','IT Strategic Plan','Create a strategic plan that defines, in co-operation with relevant stakeholders, how IT goals will contribute to the enterprise\'s strategic objectives and related costs and risks. It should include how IT will support IT-enabled investment programmes, IT services and IT assets. It should define how the objectives will be met, the measurements to be used and the procedures to obtain formal sign-off from the stakeholders. The IT strategic plan should cover investment/operational budget, funding sources, sourcing strategy, acquisition strategy, and legal and regulatory requirements. The strategic plan should be sufficiently detailed to allow for the definition of tactical IT plans.',4,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(5,1,'PO1.5','IT Tactical Plans','Create a portfolio of tactical IT plans that are derived from the IT strategic plan. The tactical plans should address IT-enabled programme investments, IT services and IT assets. The tactical plans should describe required IT initiatives, resource requirements, and how the use of resources and achievement of benefits will be monitored and managed. The tactical plans should be sufficiently detailed to allow the definition of project plans. Actively manage the set of tactical IT plans and initiatives through analysis of project and service portfolios.',5,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(6,1,'PO1.6','IT Portfolio Management','Actively manage with the business the portfolio of IT-enabled investment programmes required to achieve specific strategic business objectives by identifying, defining, evaluating, prioritising, selecting, initiating, managing and controlling programmes. This should include clarifying desired business outcomes, ensuring that programme objectives support achievement of the outcomes, understanding the full scope of effort required to achieve the outcomes, assigning clear accountability with supporting measures, defining projects within the programme, allocating resources and funding, delegating authority, and commissioning required projects at programme launch.',6,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(13,4,'PO4.1','Governance and Management of Define the IT Processes, Organisation and Relationships','Establish an effective management framework for Define the IT Processes, Organisation and Relationships ensuring strategic alignment and accountability across relevant business and IT stakeholders.',1,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(14,4,'PO4.2','Execution and Procedural Controls','Define, document and enforce standard operating controls and repeatable practices for Define the IT Processes, Organisation and Relationships.',2,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(15,4,'PO4.3','Monitoring and Performance Evaluation','Regularly assess the efficiency, reliability and compliance of Define the IT Processes, Organisation and Relationships against predefined metrics and service levels.',3,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(16,5,'PO5.1','Governance and Management of Manage the IT Investment','Establish an effective management framework for Manage the IT Investment ensuring strategic alignment and accountability across relevant business and IT stakeholders.',1,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(17,5,'PO5.2','Execution and Procedural Controls','Define, document and enforce standard operating controls and repeatable practices for Manage the IT Investment.',2,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(18,5,'PO5.3','Monitoring and Performance Evaluation','Regularly assess the efficiency, reliability and compliance of Manage the IT Investment against predefined metrics and service levels.',3,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(19,6,'PO6.1','Governance and Management of Communicate Management Aims and Direction','Establish an effective management framework for Communicate Management Aims and Direction ensuring strategic alignment and accountability across relevant business and IT stakeholders.',1,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(20,6,'PO6.2','Execution and Procedural Controls','Define, document and enforce standard operating controls and repeatable practices for Communicate Management Aims and Direction.',2,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(21,6,'PO6.3','Monitoring and Performance Evaluation','Regularly assess the efficiency, reliability and compliance of Communicate Management Aims and Direction against predefined metrics and service levels.',3,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(22,7,'PO7.1','Governance and Management of Manage IT Human Resources','Establish an effective management framework for Manage IT Human Resources ensuring strategic alignment and accountability across relevant business and IT stakeholders.',1,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(23,7,'PO7.2','Execution and Procedural Controls','Define, document and enforce standard operating controls and repeatable practices for Manage IT Human Resources.',2,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(24,7,'PO7.3','Monitoring and Performance Evaluation','Regularly assess the efficiency, reliability and compliance of Manage IT Human Resources against predefined metrics and service levels.',3,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(25,8,'PO8.1','Governance and Management of Manage Quality','Establish an effective management framework for Manage Quality ensuring strategic alignment and accountability across relevant business and IT stakeholders.',1,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(26,8,'PO8.2','Execution and Procedural Controls','Define, document and enforce standard operating controls and repeatable practices for Manage Quality.',2,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(27,8,'PO8.3','Monitoring and Performance Evaluation','Regularly assess the efficiency, reliability and compliance of Manage Quality against predefined metrics and service levels.',3,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(28,9,'PO9.1','Governance and Management of Assess and Manage IT Risks','Establish an effective management framework for Assess and Manage IT Risks ensuring strategic alignment and accountabi