ability across relevant business and IT stakeholders.',1,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(104,34,'ME4.2','Execution and Procedural Controls','Define, document and enforce standard operating controls and repeatable practices for Provide IT Governance.',2,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(105,34,'ME4.3','Monitoring and Performance Evaluation','Regularly assess the efficiency, reliability and compliance of Provide IT Governance against predefined metrics and service levels.',3,'2026-10-08 22:22:19','2026-10-08 22:22:19'),(109,2,'PO2.1','Enterprise Information Architecture Model','Establish and maintain an enterprise information architecture model to create an integrated corporate data dictionary and ensure consistency and integration across all business systems.',1,'2026-10-08 22:53:57','2026-10-08 22:53:57'),(110,2,'PO2.2','Enterprise Data Dictionary and Data Syntax Rules','Maintain the enterprise data dictionary and define corporate data syntax rules to ensure uniform interpretation and understanding of data across the enterprise.',2,'2026-10-08 22:53:57','2026-10-08 22:53:57'),(111,2,'PO2.3','Data Classification Scheme','Establish a data classification scheme that applies throughout the enterprise, based on the criticality and sensitivity (e.g., public, confidential, secret) of the data.',3,'2026-10-08 22:53:57','2026-10-08 22:53:57'),(121,3,'PO3.1','Governance and Management of Determine Technological Direction','Establish an effective management framework for Determine Technological Direction ensuring strategic alignment and accountability across relevant business and IT stakeholders.',1,'2026-10-08 23:42:06','2026-10-08 23:42:06'),(122,3,'PO3.2','Execution and Procedural Controls','Define, document and enforce standard operating controls and repeatable practices for Determine Technological Direction.',2,'2026-10-08 23:42:06','2026-10-08 23:42:06'),(123,3,'PO3.3','Monitoring and Performance Evaluation','Regularly assess the efficiency, rel