2026-10-09 00:10:37','2026-10-09 00:10:37'),(244,11,3,'Defined','Procedures have been standardised and documented, and communicated through training. It is mandated that these processes should be followed; however, it is unlikely that deviations will be detected.','2026-10-09 00:10:37','2026-10-09 00:10:37'),(245,11,4,'Managed and Measurable','Management monitors and measures compliance with procedures and takes action where processes appear not to be working effectively. Processes are under constant improvement and provide good practice.','2026-10-09 00:10:37','2026-10-09 00:10:37'),(246,11,5,'Optimised','Processes have been refined to a level of good practice, based on the results of continuous improvement and maturity modelling with other enterprises. IT is used in an integrated way to automate the workflow.','2026-10-09 00:10:37','2026-10-09 00:10:37');
